  displayName: Hardened
  description: 'A brute, physical edge on every hit, plating to match, and enough
    weight behind the swing to stagger whatever it lands on. Elemental family: Physical
    -- the one member of the family with a third effect (the push), since Physical
    has no typed-resistance twin worth calling out on its own the way the other five
    elements do.'
